      "filePath": "public/snippets/modali/dialog-conferma.html",
      "category": "modali",
      "title": "Dialog Conferma",
      "code": "<!DOCTYPE html>\n<html lang=\"it\">\n<head>\n  <meta charset=\"UTF-8\">\n  <style>\n    body {\n      margin: 0;\n      min-height: 100vh;\n      display: flex;\n      align-items: center;\n      justify-content: center;\n      background: #1e242c;\n      font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, \"Segoe UI\", Roboto, sans-serif;\n      padding: 20px;\n    }\n    .modal-box {\n      background: #262e38;\n      border: 1px solid #374353;\n      border-radius: 12px;\n      padding: 24px;\n      max-width: 360px;\n      width: 100%;\n      box-shadow: 0 20px 25px -5px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.4);\n    }\n    .modal-icon {\n      width: 42px;\n      height: 42px;\n      border-radius: 10px;\n      background: rgba(16, 185, 129, 0.15);\n      color: #10b981;\n      display: flex;\n      align-items: center;\n      justify-content: center;\n      margin-bottom: 16px;\n      font-size: 20px;\n    }\n    .modal-title {\n      margin: 0 0 8px 0;\n      font-size: 16px;\n      color: #e2e8f0;\n      font-weight: 600;\n    }\n    .modal-text {\n      margin: 0 0 20px 0;\n      font-size: 13px;\n      color: #94a3b8;\n      line-height: 1.5;\n    }\n    .modal-actions {\n      display: flex;\n      justify-content: flex-end;\n      gap: 10px;\n    }\n    .btn-secondary {\n      background: transparent;\n      border: 1px solid #475569;\n      color: #94a3b8;\n      padding: 8px 16px;\n      border-radius: 6px;\n      font-size: 13px;\n      cursor: pointer;\n    }\n    .btn-confirm {\n      background: #10b981;\n      border: none;\n      color: #0f172a;\n      padding: 8px 16px;\n      border-radius: 6px;\n      font-size: 13px;\n      font-weight: 600;\n      cursor: pointer;\n    }\n  </style>\n</head>\n<body>\n  <div class=\"modal-box\">\n    <div class=\"modal-icon\">✓</div>\n    <h3 class=\"modal-title\">Operazione Riuscita</h3>\n    <p class=\"modal-text\">Il frammento di codice HTML è stato salvato e sincronizzato correttamente.</p>\n    <div class=\"modal-actions\">\n      <button class=\"btn-secondary\">Chiudi</button>\n      <button class=\"btn-confirm\">Continua</button>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n</body>\n</html>\n"
