      "title": "Scheda Prodotto",
      "code": "<!DOCTYPE html>\n<html lang=\"it\">\n<head>\n  <meta charset=\"UTF-8\">\n  <style>\n    body {\n      margin: 0;\n      min-height: 100vh;\n      display: flex;\n      align-items: center;\n      justify-content: center;\n      background: #1e242c;\n      font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, \"Segoe UI\", Roboto, sans-serif;\n      padding: 20px;\n      box-sizing: border-box;\n    }\n    .card {\n      background: #272f3a;\n      border: 1px solid #374353;\n      border-radius: 12px;\n      width: 100%;\n      max-width: 320px;\n      overflow: hidden;\n      box-shadow: 0 8px 24px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.25);\n      transition: transform 0.2s ease, border-color 0.2s ease;\n    }\n    .card:hover {\n      transform: translateY(-3px);\n      border-color: #f59e0b;\n    }\n    .card-banner {\n      height: 120px;\n      background: linear-gradient(135deg, #f59e0b 0%, #d97706 100%);\n      display: flex;\n      align-items: center;\n      justify-content: center;\n      font-size: 36px;\n    }\n    .card-content {\n      padding: 20px;\n    }\n    .card-tag {\n      display: inline-block;\n      font-size: 11px;\n      font-weight: 700;\n      text-transform: uppercase;\n      letter-spacing: 0.8px;\n      color: #f59e0b;\n      margin-bottom: 8px;\n    }\n    .card-title {\n      margin: 0 0 10px 0;\n      font-size: 18px;\n      color: #e2e8f0;\n      font-weight: 600;\n    }\n    .card-desc {\n      margin: 0 0 18px 0;\n      font-size: 13px;\n      color: #94a3b8;\n      line-height: 1.5;\n    }\n    .card-footer {\n      display: flex;\n      align-items: center;\n      justify-content: space-between;\n      border-top: 1px solid #374353;\n      padding-top: 14px;\n    }\n    .card-price {\n      font-size: 18px;\n      font-weight: 700;\n      color: #f8fafc;\n    }\n    .card-btn {\n      background: #f59e0b;\n      color: #1e242c;\n      border: none;\n      padding: 8px 14px;\n      border-radius: 6px;\n      font-size: 12px;\n      font-weight: 600;\n      cursor: pointer;\n    }\n    .card-btn:hover {\n      background: #fbbf24;\n    }\n  </style>\n</head>\n<body>\n  <div class=\"card\">\n    <div class=\"card-banner\">📦</div>\n    <div class=\"card-content\">\n      <span class=\"card-tag\">Nuovo Arrivo</span>\n      <h3 class=\"card-title\">Kit Componenti Web</h3>\n      <p class=\"card-desc\">Raccolta di elementi UI leggeri e accessibili già ottimizzati per la resa.</p>\n      <div class=\"card-footer\">\n        <span class=\"card-price\">€29,00</span>\n        <button class=\"card-btn\">Acquista</button>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n</body>\n</html>\n"
    }
